Well, to begin with 400*10 is only 4000, mere pocket change.  However, I have
often had access to over 40,000 in gold.  Once you no longer have to pay a
shopkeeper (or can steal from him and sell stuff back to him until you bankrupt
him), you really have very few other uses for money.  It seems like I start having
trouble carrying all the gold when it gets over 25,000 or so pieces, even when my
strength is over 18.  If I have the ability to control teleport, I usually store
my excess that I can't carry in vaults (kinda fun, putting money in the Magic
Memory Vaults).  I have never tried to make a withdrawal, so I don't know if it
stays there or not, but I would bet it does.  I get greedy by castle level, and
usually get killed soon after (I suffer from acute stupidity at times).


